    "updated_at": "2022-07-18T17:32:18Z",
    "body": "That is correct. A ZLP is sent at the end of a transaction which has just sent a full packet. This is performed by the USB CDC-ACM driver and it out of the control of applications using the platform serial API, such as implementations of the Web Serial API.",
    "author_association": "COLLABORATOR",
