    "created_at": "2022-07-20T08:26:13Z",
    "updated_at": "2022-07-20T08:26:13Z",
    "body": "Well, after searching some document. I found Qualcomm firehose protocol have a configure option called \"ZlpAwareHost=0\".\r\nIn Windows it should be 1.\r\nWhich means, the device should handle the difference between Windows and Linux\r\n\r\nThanks very much. I found this solution because you mentioned \"ZLP\". So i just search it :)",
